# CODEOWNERS for Stellar Checkout
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-codeowners
#
# The repository is owned by a user account, not an organisation, so ownership
# is assigned to the maintainer directly. Team handles (@org/team) only resolve
# under an organisation — they would silently assign no reviewer at all.

# Default owner for the entire repository
*                       @determined-001

# Component-specific ownership
/packages/core/         @determined-001
/packages/stellar/      @determined-001
/packages/offramp/      @determined-001
/apps/api/              @determined-001
/apps/web/              @determined-001
/docs/                  @determined-001
/.github/               @determined-001

# Review SLA:
# All PRs assigned to code owners receive initial review feedback within
# 48 hours (business days). See docs/TRIAGE.md.
